{
    "title": "Muslim: Azkar Prayer Times",
    "description": "Welcome to the Muslim: Azkar Prayer Times app, your comprehensive Islamic companion app that enriches your spiritual journey and daily devotion. Seamlessly integrating a range of essential features, from prayer times and Qibla direction to Azkar and Quranic resources like the Holy Quran and Quran Majeed, the Muslim prayer - Quran Majeed app is designed to enhance your connection with your faith and make every moment count.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc49\ud83c\udffb Key features of the Muslim: Azkar Prayer Times app:\r\n\r\n-Azkar: Immerse yourself in the tranquility of spiritual invocations and supplications with Azkar features. From morning to night, access a collection of carefully curated Azkar and Duas that cater to various aspects of your life. Strengthen your connection with the divine through these heartfelt invocations. \r\n\r\n-Prayer Times: The app's accurate and customizable prayer time feature ensures that you never miss a prayer again. Set your location, and the app will provide you with timely reminders for each salah, helping you maintain a consistent prayer times routine. With the prayer times feature, you can manage your daily schedule around prayer time effectively. Enjoy the convenience of having prayer times reminders wherever you are.\r\n\r\n-Tasbih Counter: Elevate your dhikr practice with the built-in Tasbih Counter. Keep track of your recitations of various phrases and praise Allah as you work towards a mindful state. Whether you're seeking solace or striving to increase your spiritual presence, the Tasbih Counter is your faithful companion.\r\n\r\n-Qibla Direction: No matter where you are in the world, the app assists you in finding the Qibla direction accurately. Seamlessly align your prayers towards the Kaaba with the integrated Qibla compass. The Qibla finder is essential for those traveling or in unfamiliar places, helping you locate the Qibla direction with ease. The Qibla compass ensures precise alignment for your prayers.\r\n\r\n-Islam Map: Embark on a virtual journey to explore Islamic landmarks around the world with the Islam Map feature. Discover historical sites, mosques, and points of interest that hold cultural and spiritual significance.\r\n\r\n-Widget Integration: The prayer time app brings your faith closer to you by offering widget integration. Display essential information like prayer times, daily Azkar, or the Qibla direction right on your device's home screen. Seamlessly access your spiritual essentials without even opening the app.\r\n\r\nThe Quran Majeed and Holy Quran features provide a comprehensive Quranic experience, supporting your spiritual journey with daily recitations and teachings. With features like the Qibla finder and Tasbih Counter, this app integrates your faith into every aspect of your life.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience, knowledge, and spiritual fulfillment that come with having a comprehensive Islamic companion right at your fingertips with the Muslim prayer times - Quran Majeed app. The Quran Majeed - Qibla Direction app combines essential tools like the Qibla compass, prayer times, and Holy Quran to support your daily routines.\r\n\r\nThanks for using the Muslim prayer times - Quran Majeed app!",
